  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "In a medium saucepan, combine the canele syrup, eggs, sugar, and flour. Whisk until smooth.",
    "Add the milk, butter, salt, and vanilla extract to the saucepan. Whisk until well combined.",
